From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 11:52:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] cgroup: accept the cpuset_v2_mode mount option so Android 17
 can set up cgroups

Android 17's libprocessgroup mounts the v1 cpuset hierarchy with
"cpuset,noprefix,cpuset_v2_mode". This kernel predates the option
(Linux 4.15, e1cba4b85daa), and parse_cgroupfs_options() treats an unknown
token as a subsystem name and fails with ENOENT. init then aborts cgroup
setup, cannot create a process group for any service, and apexd-bootstrap's
reboot_on_failure ends the boot in the bootloader.

Accept the option and report it in the mount options. The behaviour it
requests upstream -- a cpuset keeping its configured cpu mask across
hotplug -- is already provided here by the Android cpus_requested change
in kernel/cpuset.c, so no cpuset.c change is needed.

---
 include/linux/cgroup-defs.h | 3 +++
 kernel/cgroup.c             | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/linux/cgroup-defs.h b/include/linux/cgroup-defs.h
index 8a590cd40be0..446df7a5a57b 100644
--- a/include/linux/cgroup-defs.h
+++ b/include/linux/cgroup-defs.h
@@ -66,6 +66,9 @@ enum {
 enum {
 	CGRP_ROOT_NOPREFIX	= (1 << 1), /* mounted subsystems have no named prefix */
 	CGRP_ROOT_XATTR		= (1 << 2), /* supports extended attributes */
+
+	/* Enable cpuset controller in v1 cgroup to use v2 behavior */
+	CGRP_ROOT_CPUSET_V2_MODE = (1 << 4),
 };
 
 /* cftype->flags */
diff --git a/kernel/cgroup.c b/kernel/cgroup.c
index 64a3b3db2484..091c5d549141 100644
--- a/kernel/cgroup.c
+++ b/kernel/cgroup.c
@@ -1674,6 +1674,8 @@ static int cgroup_show_options(struct seq_file *seq,
 		seq_puts(seq, ",noprefix");
 	if (root->flags & CGRP_ROOT_XATTR)
 		seq_puts(seq, ",xattr");
+	if (root->flags & CGRP_ROOT_CPUSET_V2_MODE)
+		seq_puts(seq, ",cpuset_v2_mode");
 
 	spin_lock(&release_agent_path_lock);
 	if (strlen(root->release_agent_path))
@@ -1738,6 +1740,10 @@ static int parse_cgroupfs_options(char *data, struct cgroup_sb_opts *opts)
 			opts->cpuset_clone_children = true;
 			continue;
 		}
+		if (!strcmp(token, "cpuset_v2_mode")) {
+			opts->flags |= CGRP_ROOT_CPUSET_V2_MODE;
+			continue;
+		}
 		if (!strcmp(token, "xattr")) {
 			opts->flags |= CGRP_ROOT_XATTR;
 			continue;
